13
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:04,080
Mayor Yu Hui and Xiao Lin are here to welcome you.

14
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:05,680
These two years of peace and quiet

15
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,120
I almost forgot

16
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,640
How to calm down and breathe
